{
  "name": "MultisigLegacy",
  "docs": [
    "The multisig build that most multisigs deployed before 2025 actually run.",
    "Written by hand on 6 Oct 2026 after the current",
    "ABI from mx-sdk-js-core failed to decode a pending action on a copy of that exact",
    "bytecode: that ABI describes a newer contract whose ActionFullInfo carries a group id",
    "and whose Action enum splits transfers into Egld and Esdt variants.",
    "",
    "The endpoints this build exports, read out of the deployed wasm, are: deposit, sign,",
    "unsign, performAction, discardAction, proposeAddBoardMember, proposeAddProposer,",
    "proposeRemoveUser, proposeChangeQuorum, proposeTransferExecute, proposeAsyncCall,",
    "proposeSCDeployFromSource, proposeSCUpgradeFromSource, plus the views below.",
    "There is no proposeTransferExecuteEsdt and there are no groups or batches."
  ],
